{"cues":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":14.88},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":16.36,"end":32.56},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":34.24,"end":46.48}],"captions":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":2.32,"text":"擠壓伸展誇張碰撞，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":2.56,"end":4.88,"text":"同時暗示材料總量一致。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":5.36,"end":6.88,"text":"高度縮短時，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":7,"end":8.16,"text":"寬度可以增加。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":8.8,"end":11.4,"text":"過度變形可能破壞輪廓，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":11.52,"end":14.88,"text":"因此要檢查接觸姿勢和完整播放。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":16.36,"end":19.52,"text":"比較擠壓 0、20、40，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":19.88,"end":21.68,"text":"在接觸時暫停，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":22,"end":23.84,"text":"同時檢查寬與高，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":24.16,"end":27.04,"text":"再觀察角色是否仍容易辨認。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":28.56,"end":30.16,"text":"碰撞時降低高度，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":30.48,"end":32.56,"text":"為何同時增加寬度？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":34.24,"end":35.84,"text":"碰撞時降低高度，"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":36.24,"end":38.4,"text":"為何同時增加寬度？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":39.6,"end":43.36,"text":"請根據剛才測試的模型或程式選擇答案。"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":43.92,"end":46.48,"text":"回饋會說明不同選項的差異。"}]}